<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 2,100 mln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 2,100 mln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said Thursday it accepted 2,100 million rupees in an open market operation in short-term federal bonds. Figures in brackets show results of Sept 4 operation.</p>
<p>		    Offered	 Accepted	Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright</p>
<p>sales  1,500 (3,200) 1,500 (2,500) 13.40 pct/yr (13.40) Five-month repo	nil	     nil		nil</p>
<p>Three-month repo     nil	     nil		nil</p>
<p>One-month repo	 650	     600		12.50</p>
<p>Total(million rupees)  2,350	   2,100</p>
<p>--Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
